      "title": "共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "套利不是只有 MEV。价差套利找目标、MEV 拼手段、API 套利拼策略。今天盘了 Gate CrossEx、Backp",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',serif}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;background:#1c1c1e;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:80px 90px 70px}\n.cover::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9a96e,#e8d5b7,#c9a96e)}\n.cover::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:3px;left:40px;right:40px;height:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.3)}\n.book-icon{position:absolute;top:50px;right:80px;width:120px;height:160px;border:2px solid rgba(201,169,110,0.3);border-radius:2px 8px 8px 2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.08),rgba(201,169,110,0.02))}\n.book-icon::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:8px;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.15)}\n.book-spine{position:absolute;top:40px;right:195px;width:6px;height:170px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.2),rgba(201,169,110,0.05));border-radius:1px}\n.tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#c9a96e;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.title{font-size:40px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.25;color:#f5f0e8;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:1px;max-width:620px}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a09580;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:540px;font-style:italic}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding-top:24px}\n.author{font-size:14px;color:#8a8070;letter-spacing:1px}\n.dot{color:#c9a96e;margin:0 6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body><div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"book-icon\"></div><div class=\"book-spine\"></div><div class=\"tag\">READING NOTES</div><h1 class=\"title\">共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本</h1><p class=\"subtitle\">套利不是只有 MEV。价差套利找目标、MEV 拼手段、API 套利拼策略。今天盘了 Gate CrossEx、Backpack、LI.FI 与 LP 过路费，并用 LI.FI 实测 25bps 固定费如何吃穿几十 bps 的价差。</p><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div></div></body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 2 天\n2026-08-06</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第二天的主题是「分层」。群里讨论时经常把两种完全不同的套利混在一起，我花了一天把它们拆开，顺便盘了四个工具，最后用真实报价算了一笔执行成本账。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论先放前面：<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">套利不是只有 MEV，而个人开发者的路，很可能不在 MEV。</strong></p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、价差套利 vs MEV 套利：先把概念分开</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">关注点</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>找<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">目标</strong>：不同市场/资产间的价格不一致</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>找<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">手段</strong>：利用交易排序权和 mempool</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">核心动作</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>买低卖高</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>抢跑 / 夹击 / 尾随</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">典型形式</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>跨所套利、三角套利、期现套利</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>三明治攻击、Back-running、清算抢跑</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">利润来源</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>市场定价失效</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>区块排序权</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">对普通用户</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>中性甚至正面（抹平价差）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>负面（抬高交易成本）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">依赖</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>多市场数据、快速执行</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>mempool 可见性、区块构建权</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">实际策略里两者经常交织：发现跨所价差是价差套利，但要用 MEV 手法抢在别人前面执行——这时价差是目标，MEV 是手段。分不清这个概念，后面讨论工具、讨论策略都会跑偏。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、今天盘的四个工具</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">1. Gate CrossEx — 跨所统一保证金</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合 Binance、OKX、Bybit、Kraken、Hyperliquid、Deribit 等 7 个交易所，核心卖点是把跨所套利的两大痛点干掉：单边爆仓风险（两边浮盈浮亏对冲）和保证金平衡（不用频繁调仓）。作者实测 SKHYNIX/SKHY 溢价 40%+，6000u 10x 杠杆赚 3500u。5 倍杠杆下传统跨所波动 20% 就单边爆仓，CrossEx 要价差拉大 20% 才爆。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">2. Backpack — 交易所把套利路径喂给你</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合数据后直接在界面展示套利路径，零门槛。但所有人看到同样的路径，利润窗口极短——本质是\"搬砖\"不是 alpha。它提醒我一件事：<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">交易所展示的机会往往是竞争最充分的，真 edge 来自信息不对称或基础设施优势。</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">3. LI.FI — 跨链执行基础设施</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合 Bridge、DEX、Solver 的统一 API。它不是策略系统——策略负责\"哪里有机会、扣完成本值不值得做\"，LI.FI 负责\"资金怎么走、要花多少钱、执行到哪一步\"。后面单独算账。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">4. LP 过路费 — 从套利机器人身上收钱</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">常规路径卷不过套利机器人，那就换个方向：在机器人经常经过的位置（高流量交易对、反复穿越的价格区间）放一个高费率池，收它的过路费。入场条件是爆量、缺池、剧烈波动、反复穿越。精髓是<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">不卷速度</strong>——承认 MEV 层面卷不过专业团队，利用他们的存在本身作为收益来源。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、用真实报价算执行成本：25 bps 能吃掉多少价差</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">跨链套利最容易踩的坑是只看两边的价格差，忽略执行磨损。我用 LI.FI 对 Ethereum USDC → Arbitrum USDC 做了一次真实只读报价（未签名、未广播）：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">输入:         1,000 USDC (Ethereum)\n预计到手:     997.5 USDC\nLI.FI 服务费: 2.5 USDC = 25 bps\nGas:          ~0.15 美元\n总显性成本:   ~2.65 美元 ≈ 26.5 bps</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">结论一：稳定币跨链没有套利空间。</strong> 表面价差只有 ~9 bps，远低于 26.5 bps 的成本线。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">结论二：25 bps 是绝对大头。</strong> 套利机会的边际经常只有几十个 bps——表面价差 20 bps，光 LI.FI 费用就吃掉了；价差 40 bps，扣完 Gas、目标链滑点、延迟风险后也未必有利润。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">算账公式：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">最低所需价差 = LI.FI Service Fee (25 bps)\n            + 两端 Gas\n            + 目标链交易滑点 + Price Impact\n            + 延迟 / 失败 / 资金占用成本\n            ≈ 30-35 bps（实测量级）</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">结论三：更适合这条路的是非稳定币。</strong> 代币化股票（如 NVDAx）、波动性资产，或者用\"预置资金\"模式——提前在各链放好钱，不临时跨链，把\"抓机会\"和\"跨链调仓\"拆开。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、个人开发者该走哪条路</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">MEV vs API 套利的分层很清楚：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">拼什么</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>mempool 监听、排序、Gas 优化、Builder 竞争</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>多 DEX 报价、价差发现、自动执行</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">需要什么</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>节点、低延迟基础设施</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>不需要节点，API 即可</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">核心竞争</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>毫秒级链上优势</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>策略、资金、滑点管理</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">适合谁</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>专业团队</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>个人开发者</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">我的结论：<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">个人开发者先做聚合套利、CEX-DEX 套利（API 层），积累策略能力后再考虑 MEV。</strong> 一层一层往上打，不要跳过 API 层直接冲链底层。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天做什么</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">第一笔 devnet swap：Jupiter API 发 swap，Solscan 查详情</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">官方路线图 L0002：AMM 与流动性深度</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">继续验证币股价差（wNVDAx vs NVDAx，0.9% 接近转换成本 1.15% 临界点）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><em>本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</em></p>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">关于「寻月隐君」</p>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none;margin:1em 0;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px;padding:16px 12px 16px 16px;vertical-align:middle;border:none;\">\n<img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VatNneOWyngu9wIEDhDoiazP1Sw9SibtJBqibyOeTTTCmSzgSbM5Ke0K6lRjQRR7ic4MJKu84iasiapb4BRF805SgoCQ/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;display:block;\" alt=\"寻月隐君\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:16px 16px 16px 0;vertical-align:middle;border:none;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;\">🌟 技术的光，未来的道｜专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 等技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。</p>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKaz18OwkcyAvXflfkWVoOTM06k6qLQBbEQgUUgVLINYaZ7ziaGLI5bAmLIMyr9HpoJsxMiasRbwCITJSpAQO79mAFEoic1vzfbwgqY/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKazG2Qk6kSrODUtqufibhAVE5IDhNdRibbEUSjatWPjH4PmMKAuTtXESBCKVGw1GflNHAas7YiccLlwmJhXcQ3OcNMdcfzh80aFl7c/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
